## Best Practices

1. **Progressive Enhancement**: Apply optimizations progressively, starting with the most impactful
2. **Documentation Completeness**: Ensure documentation covers all aspects of the component
3. **Targeted Optimization**: Focus on performance bottlenecks rather than premature optimization
4. **Accessibility First**: Treat accessibility as a core requirement, not an addon
5. **Comprehensive Testing**: Test all component behaviors, including edge cases

## Common Optimization Patterns

| Issue | Solution | Implementation |
|-------|----------|----------------|
| Frequent re-renders | React.memo | Wrap component with memo() |
| Function recreation | useCallback | Wrap event handlers with useCallback() |
| Expensive calculations | useMemo | Wrap calculations with useMemo() |
| Prop drilling | Context or composition | Extract shared state to context |
| Large component | Component splitting | Break into smaller components |

